---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Canvas Overview">
  <h1>Canvas</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    Canvas is stored as a <code>.canvas</code> file (JSON) inside your vault. Use it for spatial thinking: nodes, connectors, and layout.
  </p>

  <h2>What you can do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Drag and position nodes.</li>
    <li>Create edges with arrowheads.</li>
    <li>Export to PDF.</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>

